{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soaked in Sin is a anthology of 3 games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game is a\u00a0collection of minigames.<br>Use the mouse for all the minigames.<br>Each game will tell you how to play in the bottom left corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game is a first person shooter with multiple bullet types.<br>Use your <strong>left and right mouse</strong> button to create different bullets.\u00a0<br>Run around with <strong>WASD </strong>and <strong>shift </strong>to dash and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a 3d platformer with the goal to clean up all the trash as fast as possible.<br>Use <strong>either mouse</strong> button to pick up a trash bag and items<br>Run around with <strong>WASD</strong> and <strong>ctrl\u00a0</strong>to use the broom and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586570?t=1755177099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586570/414c1abff67cd9d2db90de465129531351931487/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755177099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586570/d966a87dcf4fb8c104c11ed9301deb839cebd560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755177099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586570/d966a87dcf4fb8c104c11ed9301deb839cebd560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755177099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence, Cartoon Blood, Cartoon Guts"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soaked in Sin is a anthology of 3 games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game is a\u00a0collection of minigames.<br>Use the mouse for all the minigames.<br>Each game will tell you how to play in the bottom left corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game is a first person shooter with multiple bullet types.<br>Use your <strong>left and right mouse</strong> button to create different bullets.\u00a0<br>Run around with <strong>WASD </strong>and <strong>shift </strong>to dash and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a 3d platformer with the goal to clean up all the trash as fast as possible.<br>Use <strong>either mouse</strong> button to pick up a trash bag and items<br>Run around with <strong>WASD</strong> and <strong>ctrl\u00a0</strong>to use the broom and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p>","developers":["SupperClub"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586570/660741f598b45d4e689069881941c0e07b4e138b/header.jpg?t=1755177099","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586570/1740763571/b6b10dbc93bb07210af8ae3e2f058d7a8116656c/1753472487/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754645753","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586570/1740763571/b6b10dbc93bb07210af8ae3e2f058d7a8116656c/1753472487/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754645753","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586570/1740763571/b6b10dbc93bb07210af8ae3e2f058d7a8116656c/1753472487/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754645753","id":257174115,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174115/movie480.mp4?t=1754645753","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174115/movie_max.mp4?t=1754645753"},"name":"Itch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174115/8ac9aee57df5d79c3fa3b698434879541ceb6c75/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754645753","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174115/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754645753","max":"https://video.